      "en": "The sons of Hassenaah built the fish gate. They laid its beams, and set up its doors, its bolts, and its bars.",
      "ko": "어문은 하스나아의 자손들이 건축하여 그 들보를 얹고 문짝을 달고 자물쇠와 빗장을 갖추었고",
      "source_text_hash": "53c49092563cef55f595bbbb36bc03e794611d12e087c1f656aa40432e7d7a10",
      "translation_text_hash": "0f776300504039465357625750b58dd0036a3afaccc9c7419e8261a349cd4c42",
